  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDitto-1M: A High-Quality Synthetic Dataset for Instruction-Based Video Editing\n\t\n\n\nDitto: Scaling Instruction-Based Video Editing with a High-Quality Synthetic Dataset \nQingyan Bai, Qiuyu Wang, Hao Ouyang, Yue Yu, Hanlin Wang, Wen Wang, Ka Leong Cheng, Shuailei Ma, Yanhong Zeng, Zichen Liu, Yinghao Xu, Yujun Shen, Qifeng Chen\n\n\n\n\n\nFigure: Our proposed synthetic data generation pipeline can automatically produce high-quality and highly diverse video editing data, encompassing both\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/QingyanBai/Ditto-1M.",
